Z||000003||Tom88gt||10-29-2000||11:03 AM||||Silicon spray.  Good on all rubber, vinyl, plastics you can find on your car.  Super easy to apply and no white, sticky mess to wipe up.  It's what Armor-all puts in their bottle.  You can buy silicon spray at any auto parts store or Wal-mart.  Way cheaper than Armor-all as well.||||reg||6
